  "summary": "Independent DE-W106 preparation continues while DE-W105 remains current. The managed packet/collector/comparator path is now supplied a Windows raw-byte execution port. Actual Windows10/Agents guest proof passes current original32MiB capacity/confinement/interruption controls and eight static x64 native I/O controls under a restricted non-elevated child and256MiB/eight-process job. Exact file/stream identities, EOF/binary bytes, refusal, timeout, descendant retirement, output monitoring and job-commit denial are observed. Owned account/image/source cleanup is verified; backing logical length unchanged, allocated delta not measured. The full source-bound host validation passes253 specification/213 tooling/81 differential tests with eight skips. Only the host mode guard and its regression then changed;82 differential tests and prepare-only staging pass. Executed native sources remain unchanged. Product private probes/collector/reference/sanitizer/full qualification, DE-W105, owner/release and main remain open.",
